# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# Use English, imperative mood, lower-case start, no trailing period.
# Keep the subject within 72 characters.
#
# Types: feat, fix, refactor, perf, test, docs, build, ci, chore, revert
# Common scopes: api, chunk, dataset, eval, index, retrieval, docs, repo
#
# Add a body when the motivation or trade-off is not obvious.
# Add "BREAKING CHANGE: ..." in the footer for incompatible changes.
